sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as DiagramEditor UI
  participant Diagram
  participant VS as ValidationService
  participant MM as Active Metamodel
  participant CR as ConnectionRules
  participant VPR as ViewpointRules
  participant VR as ValidationRules
  participant Result as ValidationResult

  User->>UI: Create or edit diagram
  UI->>Diagram: Set/update component and connection instances
  UI->>Diagram: Ensure metamodelId or use active metamodel
  User->>UI: Validate diagram
  UI->>VS: validateDiagram(diagram, state)
  VS->>MM: Load active metamodel
  VS->>CR: Check each ConnectionInstance
  VS->>VPR: Check optional Viewpoint constraints
  VS->>VR: Check mandatory/quality rules
  VS->>Result: Produce errors and warnings
  Result-->>UI: Structured ValidationMessages
  UI-->>User: Show grouped errors and warnings
